WEBVTT

00:03.017 --> 00:04.484
Legend has it...

00:05.653 --> 00:08.451
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.790 --> 00:14.092
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.597 --> 00:20.762
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.881 --> 00:41.310
<i>Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.589 --> 00:47.425
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.930 --> 00:54.869
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.537 --> 01:00.303
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:00.408 --> 01:03.605
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:07.382 --> 01:14.447
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.622 --> 01:20.458
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:21.295 --> 01:28.599
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.770 --> 01:37.178
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.879 --> 01:39.540
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:49.290 --> 01:52.691
<i>Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:56.397 --> 01:58.763
So you are Iori, sir?

01:59.767 --> 02:01.029
But Lord Musashi!

02:01.135 --> 02:04.798
You said yourself he is unpolished.
Would that not be disrespectful?

02:05.306 --> 02:08.707
In the event that Iori is defeated...

02:10.211 --> 02:13.647
...then I, Musashi, will
have been defeated...

02:14.182 --> 02:16.241
...you may leave it at that.

02:17.051 --> 02:18.382
I shall meet him...

02:18.519 --> 02:22.114
I shall take on the Mutsu Enmei Style!

02:22.957 --> 02:27.985
<i>TAKATO AND TSUBURA</i>

02:51.819 --> 02:53.081
Is that him?

02:53.621 --> 02:54.519
Here goes...

03:01.062 --> 03:02.154
No way...

03:28.222 --> 03:30.486
Are you sure you have the right man?

03:31.159 --> 03:33.593
I serve the Ogasawara clan, my name is...

03:47.074 --> 03:48.803
...Iori Miyamoto.

03:59.587 --> 04:03.284
So I'm the man you want after all.

04:25.947 --> 04:27.278
I see...

04:27.481 --> 04:29.142
So you're a Yagyu.

04:29.684 --> 04:35.850
That form, I believe it's called the
Shinkage Style chuudan no kurai, is it not?

04:37.692 --> 04:40.957
As I'm replacing Lord Musashi
in the Shogun's Tournament...

04:41.095 --> 04:43.928
...you came to test my skills in advance...

04:44.065 --> 04:45.623
Is that what's going on?

05:15.296 --> 05:16.160
Now's your chance!

05:29.744 --> 05:31.371
W-What the...

05:38.719 --> 05:39.651
You bastard!

05:39.787 --> 05:40.879
You stay the hell out of this!

05:42.657 --> 05:44.022
I'm a girl, dammit!

05:44.125 --> 05:46.923
How could you mistake this
pretty face for a boy's?

05:47.028 --> 05:47.824
Moron!

05:48.362 --> 05:52.662
Anyway, is that any way to thank me
for saving your life, you ingrate?

05:54.969 --> 05:56.493
And what's up with you?

05:56.637 --> 05:59.868
If I hadn't stepped in, you
would've slashed them all to ribbons!

06:04.712 --> 06:05.736
Cut it out...

06:06.013 --> 06:07.037
...I said!

06:07.248 --> 06:08.146
Are you deaf?

06:12.153 --> 06:14.951
This girl is not just any girl.

06:15.323 --> 06:19.453
Handling these Yagyu
henchmen like child's play...

06:20.194 --> 06:21.855
And unarmed, too!

06:21.996 --> 06:24.556
Right, then. My lord Iori Miyamoto.

06:24.699 --> 06:27.759
This isn't exactly the
arena I had in mind, but...

06:50.591 --> 06:52.559
What a racket they're making...

06:52.927 --> 06:54.554
Very impressive.

06:54.929 --> 06:57.090
I meant to hit you with that kick, but...

06:57.198 --> 07:00.759
...that was Musashi's issun no mikiri, eh?

07:04.805 --> 07:06.932
Hey! You pay attention!

07:07.408 --> 07:10.468
That's the only reason why
I bothered to save your life.

07:11.645 --> 07:15.445
You're gonna witness this
duel, and report to your master.

07:16.517 --> 07:19.782
See who's really worthy of taking
part in the Shogun's Tournament.

07:21.956 --> 07:22.923
Are you serious?

07:23.624 --> 07:26.525
Forgive me for not
providing a larger audience...

08:27.188 --> 08:30.487
Why don't you tell me your name, then...

08:33.294 --> 08:35.990
The Mutsu Enmei Style's...

08:39.133 --> 08:41.465
Tsubura Mutsu!

08:52.847 --> 08:54.144
Mutsu...

08:54.682 --> 08:55.910
That's what you said just now?

08:56.951 --> 08:58.179
Yeah, so what?

08:59.286 --> 09:00.844
Big Brother Yakumo...

09:00.955 --> 09:03.014
How is Yakumo doing?

09:05.259 --> 09:06.624
Dammit!

09:10.664 --> 09:11.892
Get in position!

09:16.570 --> 09:18.333
Whoa! Outta the way!

09:18.639 --> 09:19.799
Move it, old man!

09:26.080 --> 09:27.138
Holy crap...

09:28.682 --> 09:29.979
One eye?

09:31.285 --> 09:32.616
...I've heard the rumors...

09:36.957 --> 09:41.860
...of a one-eyed swordsman
of tremendous skill...

09:43.164 --> 09:46.895
His name is Jubei Yagyu...

09:48.769 --> 09:51.294
Don't tell me, this guy is...

09:51.472 --> 09:52.370
I stepped on you?

09:52.640 --> 09:53.868
Are you all right?

09:54.008 --> 09:55.100
Don't touch me!

09:55.242 --> 09:56.573
Sorry, sorry!

09:59.413 --> 10:02.075
Old man! Could you loan
me that pot of yours?

10:02.183 --> 10:02.979
Huh?

10:04.919 --> 10:05.578
Hey!

10:06.787 --> 10:07.947
Are you hungry?

10:08.055 --> 10:11.582
How about some boar stew, to
make up for squashing your hand?

10:11.992 --> 10:12.856
No thanks!

10:14.028 --> 10:15.256
Well, okay.

10:15.829 --> 10:16.989
What about you guys?

10:18.232 --> 10:19.824
Well, it's certainly a big one.

10:20.134 --> 10:23.262
I'm sure it's too much meat
for you to finish alone.

10:26.106 --> 10:27.801
You too! Come help us.

10:28.976 --> 10:31.706
I bet the meat's real
fatty, it'll be good!

10:52.333 --> 10:54.130
Mmm, this is great!

10:54.268 --> 10:55.098
Old man?

10:55.202 --> 10:55.827
Huh?

10:56.103 --> 10:57.695
It's your pot, you know.

10:57.871 --> 10:59.702
Go ahead and eat as much as you want.

10:59.807 --> 11:03.743
Oh, no, sir. I'm getting the chance to
eat boar just for lending you the pot.

11:04.078 --> 11:06.546
I'll just take whatever's left over.

11:06.847 --> 11:10.214
I advise you to eat, there
won't be anything left over!

11:12.586 --> 11:13.883
What's so funny?

11:13.988 --> 11:14.955
Nothing...

11:15.155 --> 11:17.851
I was just thinking of how Yakumo
used to scarf food down, too.

11:29.970 --> 11:33.269
And as soon as I'm good enough
not to get in Musashi's way...

11:37.211 --> 11:38.576
...I'm going to join him...

11:38.679 --> 11:41.739
...and he's going to teach me
everything he knows about swordsmanship!

11:42.816 --> 11:45.512
I was just a cocksure little boy...

11:45.986 --> 11:48.147
It seems like only yesterday.

11:53.427 --> 11:55.554
It's been more than 20 years...

11:56.230 --> 11:58.562
...and I'm a lot older now.

11:59.033 --> 12:02.867
But who would guess that
Yakumo had a grown-up daughter?

12:03.737 --> 12:05.796
How old is Yakumo now, anyway?

12:06.774 --> 12:07.832
Uh, um...

12:08.409 --> 12:10.570
H-He's 50 now.

12:10.844 --> 12:11.833
50?

12:13.047 --> 12:16.346
He can't be that old yet. When
I met him he was only 17 or 18.

12:16.450 --> 12:18.816
I never really knew
my father, all right?

12:19.119 --> 12:20.347
Never knew?

12:20.888 --> 12:23.049
But then who taught
you to fight like that?

12:23.524 --> 12:25.287
My mother...

12:29.530 --> 12:30.895
Your mother?

12:32.733 --> 12:35.998
But Yakumo was the only one who could...

12:38.572 --> 12:39.504
Listen, you...

12:50.684 --> 12:52.345
It's getting kind of chilly, huh?

12:52.453 --> 12:53.511
What did you expect?

12:53.620 --> 12:55.485
Are you going to sit
there naked forever?

12:56.056 --> 12:57.455
Where are your clothes?

12:57.725 --> 13:00.250
And also, why don't you
at least tell us your name?

13:02.796 --> 13:04.559
Hey, where are you going?

13:05.766 --> 13:07.825
I forgot I was in the middle of a wash.

13:08.402 --> 13:10.393
Now where'd I leave them?

13:12.873 --> 13:14.704
Tell me your mother's name!

13:18.712 --> 13:22.239
I wasn't planning to take
you on without an audience...

13:22.883 --> 13:26.216
...but you seem to know too
much for your own good.

13:26.587 --> 13:31.923
If you want an audience... look,
there's someone right behind me...

13:35.529 --> 13:36.461
Sasuke!

13:36.730 --> 13:38.254
Sasuke, you say?

13:38.732 --> 13:40.029
Now I see...

13:40.300 --> 13:43.895
I did think he was too
calm to be just any old man.

13:44.471 --> 13:48.567
But I'm impressed that he kept his
skills hidden from me until just now...

13:49.309 --> 13:53.473
Twenty years ago when
Osaka Castle was destroyed...

13:56.650 --> 14:00.381
...they say there was a
ninja warrior named Sasuke...

14:00.521 --> 14:04.150
...who fell in battle along
with his master, Yukimura Sanada...

14:08.662 --> 14:10.425
If he were still alive...

14:10.631 --> 14:13.725
He would be about your
age by now, wouldn't he?

14:16.603 --> 14:17.535
Young Miss!

14:22.309 --> 14:23.833
Young Miss, eh?

14:24.445 --> 14:27.278
From what you've let slip,
if I'm guessing correctly...

14:27.714 --> 14:32.310
The girl must be a
descendant of the Sanada clan.

14:33.287 --> 14:36.654
Otherwise, why would
someone of Sasuke's stature...

14:36.757 --> 14:39.555
...be distracted over a mere pot
that he knows you can dodge?

14:41.395 --> 14:43.522
You must be more than
just a female ninja...

14:45.265 --> 14:50.259
It looks like I've hit pretty
close to home, wouldn't you say?

14:51.338 --> 14:54.239
So what would a surviving member
of the Sanada clan be doing...

14:54.541 --> 14:56.941
...posing as a Mutsu and
challenging me to a duel?

14:57.144 --> 14:59.112
What are you plotting?

15:15.329 --> 15:16.159
Bailing, are you?

15:16.897 --> 15:18.091
Right, I'm bailing!

15:18.232 --> 15:20.132
It's two against one,
the odds aren't good!

15:20.601 --> 15:24.970
And besides, if you're a girl, it
just wouldn't do for me to kill you!

15:28.942 --> 15:30.534
You don't have to worry...

15:31.178 --> 15:35.342
I don't know what you're plotting,
but your secret's safe with me.

15:36.016 --> 15:38.314
There's one thing on my agenda...

15:38.619 --> 15:42.783
...to defeat the Yagyu Clan in the
Shogun's Tournament, nothing more!

15:43.223 --> 15:48.092
Goodbye, be sure to thank
Jubei for the boar stew for me!

15:52.232 --> 15:53.529
Follow him! Sasuke!

15:53.934 --> 15:56.767
If I go after him alone, I'll be killed.

15:57.704 --> 16:00.537
Well, well! I must say he duped us both.

16:02.109 --> 16:05.101
So you're one of the
last living Sanadas?

16:06.013 --> 16:08.106
Sounds like juicy gossip!

16:14.288 --> 16:18.122
But hey, I have to tell
you, my name's not Jubei.

16:18.492 --> 16:21.052
But your eye!

16:21.461 --> 16:24.021
Oh, you mean this?

16:24.164 --> 16:25.529
It's a habit of mine.

16:26.500 --> 16:28.525
Oh, man!

16:31.605 --> 16:33.766
What a waste!

16:35.943 --> 16:39.003
Who the hell are you?

16:40.213 --> 16:42.181
You mean my name?

16:43.283 --> 16:44.773
Just call me Takato.

16:50.757 --> 16:52.088
What the...

16:52.192 --> 16:53.454
What are you looking at?

16:53.594 --> 16:54.891
Oh, and by the way...

16:54.995 --> 16:57.862
I guess you could say I'm on your side...

16:58.098 --> 16:58.860
What!

16:58.999 --> 17:00.523
You have a past, don't you?

17:26.360 --> 17:28.225
You are very hard to read, sir...

17:29.663 --> 17:31.927
Nothing to read about me.

17:33.066 --> 17:34.260
Sasuke...

17:34.601 --> 17:38.628
Young Miss, it would be wise
to join forces with this man.

17:38.739 --> 17:39.433
Sasuke!

17:40.107 --> 17:42.871
All right, now that that's settled...

17:43.076 --> 17:44.304
Let's go!

17:46.179 --> 17:48.773
Tsubura Mutsu!

17:53.086 --> 17:54.212
In your dreams!

17:56.356 --> 17:56.845
Sasuke?

17:57.658 --> 18:00.559
Hey, come back here! Sasuke!

18:09.903 --> 18:12.667
So you failed to kill Iori?

18:12.806 --> 18:14.865
Yes. Forgive me, master.

18:15.542 --> 18:19.069
Lord Musashi was not joking when
he said that whoever defeated Iori...

18:19.212 --> 18:21.305
...could consider himself
having defeated Musashi.

18:22.015 --> 18:25.382
Not only that, but we were
thwarted by another interloper...

18:25.485 --> 18:26.782
What do you mean?

18:27.320 --> 18:28.878
This person was...

18:29.489 --> 18:29.956
<i>Yagyu Shinkage Style</i>

18:29.956 --> 18:31.091
<i>What?
Yagyu Shinkage Style</i>

18:31.091 --> 18:31.491
<i>Yagyu Shinkage Style</i>

18:31.491 --> 18:34.392
<i>Where is Matajuro?
Yagyu Shinkage Style</i>

18:34.528 --> 18:36.393
Sir! What is the matter, Father?

18:37.397 --> 18:42.096
Matajuro, do you know if
Jubei has arrived in Edo yet?

18:42.202 --> 18:47.105
Yes, I've been notified by the Yamato
Yagyus that he left quite a while ago...

18:47.607 --> 18:49.472
...he'll be here any day now...

18:51.344 --> 18:55.974
I sent the Ura-Yagyus to test
the skills of this Iori Miyamoto...

18:56.249 --> 18:58.114
...who's competing in Musashi's place...

18:58.585 --> 19:01.053
...but as befits the son of that demon...

19:02.289 --> 19:04.553
...he's more than able.

19:05.459 --> 19:08.724
You're saying that I
couldn't defeat him?

19:10.630 --> 19:12.029
No, you couldn't.

19:15.035 --> 19:17.003
According to Samon...

19:17.137 --> 19:21.005
...the Shogun is secretly planning
to hold an elimination tournament.

19:21.575 --> 19:24.874
To determine who is truly the
best swordsman in the nation!

19:26.780 --> 19:30.341
Needless to say, our Edo
Yagyu Style must prevail.

19:30.517 --> 19:33.452
We cannot risk being
defeated at any cost!

19:33.887 --> 19:34.911
Father!

19:35.055 --> 19:36.113
Matajuro...

19:36.223 --> 19:36.951
Sir?

19:37.524 --> 19:40.049
Have you ever heard of the Enmei Style?

19:41.595 --> 19:46.532
I believe that the Enmei Style was an
earlier name for Musashi Miyamoto's...

19:46.767 --> 19:48.200
...Niten Ichi Style.

19:48.635 --> 19:51.968
The style I'm referring to
now bears the "Mutsu" name...

19:52.372 --> 19:53.304
Mutsu?

19:54.040 --> 19:56.907
Are you talking about
the Mutsu Enmei Style?

19:57.544 --> 19:59.774
Musashi took on the Enmei name...

19:59.880 --> 20:02.371
...because he was once
defeated by this Mutsu...

20:02.482 --> 20:04.074
...that's what I've heard.

20:06.153 --> 20:08.053
Are you quite sure about that?

20:08.688 --> 20:13.785
I am not positive, but someone did
relate this story to the Shogun.

20:14.027 --> 20:17.258
The Shogun was quite piqued by the tale...

20:17.397 --> 20:19.388
...and now he wishes to
invite Mutsu to the tournament...

20:19.533 --> 20:21.023
...or so I've been told.

20:21.234 --> 20:25.227
But Father, I'm sure it's
all just a lot of gossip.

20:25.372 --> 20:28.535
If such a man really existed, he
would certainly threaten our stature...

20:28.775 --> 20:30.800
...as Yagyus, along with Iori Miyamoto...

20:30.944 --> 20:33.276
...but I just don't
believe that he exists...

20:34.314 --> 20:38.216
And what if it turns out
this Mutsu does exist...

20:38.418 --> 20:40.045
...then what, Matajuro?

20:42.856 --> 20:45.757
Just as I thought, Jubei...

20:46.393 --> 20:49.123
I have no choice but
to rely on your skills.

20:50.063 --> 20:52.691
But now that the Yagyu
clan is in crisis...

20:52.866 --> 20:54.390
...that idiot son of mine...

20:54.868 --> 20:57.462
Where the hell is he when I need him?

21:16.857 --> 21:21.817
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.973 --> 21:45.010
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:45.285 --> 21:54.990
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:55.128 --> 22:04.161
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:04.304 --> 22:14.976
<i>Even if it's just hello,
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:16.016 --> 22:22.148
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:22.522 --> 22:25.514
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:26.393 --> 22:32.628
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.933 --> 22:38.462
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:53.453 --> 22:55.080
A man who answers to no one...

22:55.255 --> 22:59.521
...single-mindedly following
his chosen path... Jubei!

23:01.094 --> 23:02.755
Next episode of Age of Chaos...

23:02.862 --> 23:04.830
<i>A MAN OF NO SCRUPLES</i>

23:04.898 --> 23:06.866
Pay close attention, and wait!
